                    <div class="margin-bottom">
                        <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
                        <h2>From Disclosure to Company</h2>
                        <p>The Founders Elect process is designed to be fast and friction-free, with legal template documents available at each stage.</p>
                        <ol>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Submit an Invention Disclosure</strong>
                                <p>File a disclosure with OISP. Your assigned program manager will conduct an initial review and reach out within 10 business days.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Market &amp; Commercialization Assessment</strong>
                                <p>OISP conducts an up-front assessment of market opportunity and competitive landscape. You receive a research report to inform your path selection.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Select Your Path</strong>
                                <p>Choose Founder Path (high equity, foundational support) or Partnership Path (shared equity, enhanced OISP engagement). Path-specific terms apply from this point.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Execute Option Agreement</strong>
                                <p>Sign the standard two-year option agreement (with the License Agreement attached as an exhibit). Company formation support begins.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Incorporate &amp; Operate</strong>
                                <p>OISP supports company incorporation using template documents, IP maintenance on your foundational technology, and introductions to incubator space and the investor community.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Execute License &amp; Launch</strong>
                                <p>Execute the definitive license agreement. University equity is issued. You are now an operating startup with OISP as an ongoing institutional partner.</p>
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>

                </div>

